1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,860
I Love eating ice cream
我喜欢吃冰淇淋

2
00:00:01,879 --> 00:00:04,317
Ice cream comes in many flavors
冰淇淋有很多种口味

3
00:00:04,318 --> 00:00:06,740
and my favorite is strawberry
我最喜欢的是草莓味的。

4
00:00:07,078 --> 00:00:09,939
Eating ice cream in the summer is the best
夏天吃冰淇淋是最好的

5
00:00:10,239 --> 00:00:12,019
because it cools me down
因为它让我冷静下来

6
00:00:12,079 --> 00:00:13,198
Sometimes
有时

7
00:00:13,198 --> 00:00:15,980
I go to the ice cream shop with my family
我和家人一起去冰淇淋店

8
00:00:16,039 --> 00:00:19,059
and everyone chooses their favorite flavor
每个人都选择自己喜欢的口味

9
00:00:19,318 --> 00:00:21,478
Ice cream is not only delicious
冰淇淋不仅好吃

10
00:00:21,478 --> 00:00:23,179
but also makes me happy
但也让我开心

11
00:00:23,478 --> 00:00:25,358
Every time I eat ice cream
每次我吃冰淇淋的时候

12
00:00:25,359 --> 00:00:26,801
it's a joyful moment
这是一个快乐的时刻

